					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-855594#post-2023641</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-855594/cavalcade-hub#post-2023641</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 01 May 2014 17:16:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ShenHibiki</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1393550</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Rule 4: No tale can include a character who has appeared in the previous two tales.<br /> Rule 5: Every tale must include at least one character who has been used before in Cavalcade.</p> <p>Ok, wait&#8230;</p> <p>The third story needs to include a character that's used before&#8230; but not on the previous two?&#8230;<br /> The 4th can ony use one from the first story&#8230; and I hope every story includes at least two new characters, or that'll force a 3-stories-back situation, in a way&#8230;?</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
